+// DOCUMENTS: the shared LB-hop step behind the stage-2..5 machine (trace.js)
+// and the stage-6 chain (trace-stage6.js chainStep s5 === 2) — R1a, finding
+// 1-01's unification. The real `lb.enqueue` runs here and the frame is
